  "sourceFooter": "DISCLAIMER: By submitting this exception request form, the seller certifies that (i) seller has made, or is making, its own credit decision with respect to the loan to the borrower, regardless of whether the investor approves or declines to approve the exception request herein; (ii) none of the investor, its directors, officers, employees, agents, contractors, or affiliates has influenced, or will influence, the seller's credit decision with respect to the loan to the borrower; and (iii) if seller has closed, or in the future does close, the loan to the borrower, seller did, or will, fund the closing of the loan with funds from a source other than the investor. This request and any responses are non-binding. Responses are based on information provided as of the submission date and are subject to change. Rate, terms, and programs may change without notice.\n\nGriffin Funding, Inc. | Confidential – For Investor Use Only — Form GF-EXC-2026-v3.0",
  "checklist": [],
